# T-236: the FLEET-WIDE systemd prefix drop-in. Not a unit -- systemd applies
# "radon-.service.d/" to every unit named radon-*, so this one file's blast
# radius is the whole fleet, and it was the only installed artifact under
# services/ with no sha256 pin. Installed by setup-vps.sh:install_fleet_dropin
# on a fresh host and, since 2026-10-31, re-installed by the control plane
# (CONTROL_PLANE_SOURCES; bootstrap kind `fleet-dropin`) on every refresh. NOT
# by the per-release install-units verb, whose manifest regex matches bare
# radon-*.{service,timer} names only and ignores this line by design; the
# daily drift audit compares it live as `fleet-dropin`.
