# radon-mktnews (2026-08-30 headlines incident). The hub has been serving
# production /ws-headlines while its unit sat behind a `not-installed:` ack —
# the R-092 trapdoor: excluded from every automated install path, so unit
# edits (and the REL-155/163 ExecStart contract) could drift from the host
# copy with nothing at review time saying so. Manifest-pinned from this
# commit: install-units converges the body on the next deploy; being a
